**/opencode/skills/**

# OpenCode plugin install artifacts (auto-generated)
**/opencode/node_modules/
**/opencode/package.json
**/opencode/package-lock.json
**/opencode/bun.lock

# OpenCode V2 service registration (auto-generated, contains a secret)
**/opencode/service.json

# moshi-hook OpenCode plugin + its TUI helper (written by `moshi-hook install`)
**/opencode/plugins/moshi-hooks.ts
**/opencode/plugins/moshi-hooks-tui/

# herdr runtime artifacts (auto-generated by the running client/server)
**/herdr/.plugins.lock
**/herdr/session.json
**/herdr/session-snapshots/
**/herdr/*.log
